  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Riziki Source</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Riziki Source is a social enterprise that facilitates connection to employment opportunities for persons with disabilities in Kenyathrough the use of technology and training of job seekers with disabilities in soft skills and employers on matters arounddisability inclusion. We have been active for the last three years though we were founded in 2015. Our vision is a world where persons with disabilities thrive in the work economy. Our values espouse diversity, inclusion and integrity. We recognize that all of us are different in one way or another and this is something to celebrate than shun and thus embracing our various differences makes us great. we strive to include every one of us in our initiative, no one should go unheard whether if it is making adecision or contributing towards a particular cause that we embark on as a team. Every voice matters and is celebrated. We hold ourselves to the highest standards and our actions should be beyond reproach and always in good faith. We have founded an online platform where persons with disabilities looking for job opportunities can register into a database that makes it easier to be recognized and spotted by employers thus eliminating the barrier to employment which has existed for long. Many of our beneficiaries have gone on to find employment using our platform. We have also had an opportunity to train employers on disability inclusion making it possible for them to navigate therecruitment process while including potential employees with various types ofdisabilities. We are proud of being the promoters of an active conversation on disability and employment in Kenya as well as facilitating persons with disabilities to lead independent lives from employment. We are a unique organization because we are founded by someone with a lived experience of disability and we employ technology in removing barriers for employment for persons with disabilities. We also work with all categories of disabilities to promote their inclusion in work places. This project willelevate the importance of our work and increase our partnerships as we seek to find more opportunities for persons with disabilities to get employment in different industries. By being recognized, this will improve our brand thus enabling other corporateorganizations to associate with us giving us a head- start in finding employment opportunities. In addition, the project will enable us reach more persons with disabilities through our outreach activities and trainings to prepare them for job market.</narrative>
  </description>
